// Approximation of what a dog's cones capture, not of what a dog subjectively experiences. Assumes sRGB input and a modelled display (Gaussian primaries); see src/prototype/README.md.

// GLSL mat3(...) takes its arguments COLUMN-major. Each block shows the row-major matrix.
// Use as: vec3 outLinear = DOG_V2 * inLinear;   (declare `precision highp float;` in the shader)

